   note:"An unauthenticated POST to any OpenAPI-validated endpoint, including the anonymous POST /edge/validate and POST /edge/issue-token, crashes the entire Unleash server with one request body of deeply-nested JSON. GitHub rates it high (CVSS 7.5). 2 more advisories for unleash-server came out the same day.",
